-is-not-ready","content":"Run `zg server run` when you need foreground logs. See Local Server for lifecycle, client mode, listen address, and authentication.","locale":"en"},"864":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#an-agent-cannot-use-zvec-grep","content":"Restart the Agent or open a new session. Exact identifiers and filenames may correctly use its native grep instead of Zvec-Grep. See Connect AI Agents.","locale":"en"},"865":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Inspect or grant the separate workspace authorization:","locale":"en"},"866":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#remote-embedding-is-denied","content":"Use `--allow-remote` for one command, or choose a local model when content must not leave the machine.","locale":"en"},"867":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"`--drop` deletes the workspace index, not the source files. Indexed search remains unavailable until you build another index.","locale":"en"},"868":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting#reset-safely","content":"When reporting a problem, include the version, operating system, failing command, relevant `zg status`, and sanitized diagnostics. Remove credentials, private paths, and sensitive excerpts.","locale":"en"},"869":{"id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/en/docs/zvec-grep/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","u