ncepts/fts-index-75","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#5-wand-optimization","content":"This enables efficient top-k retrieval on large datasets without fully scoring every candidate document.","locale":"en"},"1306":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-76","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#tokenizers","content":"Tokenizers determine how text is split into terms, directly affecting retrieval quality. The same tokenizer configuration is used for both indexing and querying. See Tokenizers for configuration details.","locale":"en"},"1307":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-77","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#index-time-parameters","content":"Parameter","locale":"en"},"1308":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-78","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#index-time-parameters","content":"Description","locale":"en"},"1309":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-79","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#index-time-parameters","content":"Tuning Guidance","locale":"en"},"1310":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-80","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#index-time-parameters","content":"`tokenizer_name`","locale":"en"},"1311":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-81","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#index-time-parameters","content":"**Tokenizer** used to split text into searchable tokens","locale":"en"},"1312":{"id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index-82","page_id":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/concepts/fts-index#index-time-parameters","content":"Use `