ve a `collection` object ready.","locale":"en"},"1500":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete-14","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete#delete-by-ids","content":"Use `delete()` to remove one or more documents when you know their exact IDs.","locale":"en"},"1501":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete-15","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete#delete-by-ids","content":"When given a single `id`, `delete()` returns one `Status` object.","locale":"en"},"1502":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete-16","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete#delete-by-ids","content":"When given a list of `id`s, it returns a list of `Status` objects in the same order.","locale":"en"},"1503":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete-17","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete#delete-by-filter-condition","content":"Use `delete_by_filter()` to remove all documents that match a boolean `filter` expression.","locale":"en"},"1504":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete-18","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/delete#delete-by-filter-condition","content":"The `filter` can reference scalar fields (e.g., `publish_year`, `language`) using comparison and logical operators.","locale":"en"},"1505":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/fetch","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/fetch","type":"page","content":"Fetch","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Products","Zvec","Guides","Data Operations"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/fetch","locale":"en"},"1506":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/fetch-0","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/fetch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/fetch","content":"Use `fetch()` 