perations/insert#insert-a-single-document","content":"Insert a Single Document","locale":"en"},"1533":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-2","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert#insert-a-batch-of-documents","content":"Insert a Batch of Documents","locale":"en"},"1534":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-3","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert#insert-documents-with-sparse-vectors","content":"Insert Documents with Sparse Vectors","locale":"en"},"1535":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-4","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert#insert-documents-with-multiple-fields-and-vectors","content":"Insert Documents with Multiple Fields and Vectors","locale":"en"},"1536":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-5","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","content":"Use the &#x2A;*`insert()`** method to add one or more new documents (`Doc`) to a collection.","locale":"en"},"1537":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-6","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","content":"**Performance Tip**:\\\nNew vectors are initially buffered for fast ingestion. For optimal search performance, call `optimize()` after inserting a large batch of documents.","locale":"en"},"1538":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-7","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert#document-doc","content":"Each `Doc` passed to `insert()` must:","locale":"en"},"1539":{"id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert-8","page_id":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/db/data-operations/insert#document-doc","content":"H