l":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"3754":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","content":"使用 `open()` 函数从磁盘加载已有的 collection。","locale":"zh"},"3755":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","content":"指定的路径**必须指向一个已有的 Zvec collection**。如果未找到有效的 collection，`open()` 将抛出错误。","locale":"zh"},"3756":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`path`：Collection 目录的具体路径。","locale":"zh"},"3757":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`option`：控制运行时行为的配置。","locale":"zh"},"3758":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`read_only`：以只读模式打开 collection。在此模式下，任何写入尝试均会触发错误异常。","locale":"zh"},"3759":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"当需要在多个进程间共享集合时，请使用只读模式。这能确保并发访问的安全性，有效规避数据损坏的风险。","locale":"zh"},"3760":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/open#参数","content":"`enable_mmap`：\n启用内存映射 I/O 以加速数据访问 (默认为 `True`)。该机制通过略微增加内存缓存的占用，来换取显著的性能提升。","locale":"zh"},"3761":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"page","content":"优化","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","locale":"zh"},"3762":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"为什么需要优化","locale":"zh"},"3763":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#使用示例","content":"使用示例","locale":"zh"},"3764":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"检查索引状态","locale":"zh"},"3765":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"何时调用 `optimize()`","locale":"zh"},"3766":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","content":"`optimize()` 方法将 Flat 暂存区中累积的向量合并构建到配置的向量索引中，从而**提升检索性能**。该操作在**后台运行**，**不会阻塞读取或写入操作**，从而确保应用程序始终保持响应。","locale":"zh"},"3767":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"在 Zvec 中，新插入的向量**不会直接**添加到已配置的向量索引中。这些新向量会先被暂存到一个轻量级的 Flat 索引 (暴力检索)缓冲区。","locale":"zh"},"3768":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"这种设计带来了显著的优势，但也伴随着一定的取舍:","locale":"zh"},"3769":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"✅ **优势**","locale":"zh"},"3770":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**最大化写入吞吐量**：实现高速数据写入。","locale":"zh"},"3771":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**流式写入**：为原生不支持流式增量更新的索引类型 (如 IVF)，提供实时写入的能力。","locale":"zh"},"3772":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"⚠️ **取舍**","locale":"zh"},"3773":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"**搜索性能随写入量衰减**：随着 Flat 暂存区增长，搜索性能会下降。","locale":"zh"},"3774":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"🔁 **解决方案**","locale":"zh"},"3775":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"定期调用 `optimize()`。这会触发后台工作线程，将暂存区中的向量合并到已配置的向量索引中 — 且**不会中断正在进行的读写操作**。🚀","locale":"zh"},"3776":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#为什么需要优化","content":"`optimize()` **不会锁定 collection**。优化过程中，其他线程和操作可以继续无感地读取、写入和查询 — 应用程序将保持完全响应。","locale":"zh"},"3777":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"使用 `stats` 属性获取 collection 索引状态的实时信息：","locale":"zh"},"3778":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`doc_count`：当前存储的 document 总数。","locale":"zh"},"3779":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`index_completeness`：表示向量数据已建立索引的比例 (0.0\\~1.0)。","locale":"zh"},"3780":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`1.0` →  该向量字段的所有向量均已建立索引","locale":"zh"},"3781":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"`0.0` → 尚未进行任何索引；所有向量仍暂存在 Flat 缓冲区中，并通过暴力检索进行查询","locale":"zh"},"3782":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#检查索引状态","content":"**介于两者之间** → 部分向量已构建索引，或正在索引中","locale":"zh"},"3783":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**定期**执行优化，但**不宜过于频繁**：","locale":"zh"},"3784":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**频率过低** → Flat 缓冲区过大，导致检索性能下降","locale":"zh"},"3785":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**频率过高** → 浪费资源，过早优化小批量数据","locale":"zh"},"3786":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"请根据您的**数据写入速率**和**查询延迟要求**进行权衡。","locale":"zh"},"3787":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/optimize#何时调用-optimize","content":"**最佳实践：**\\\n如果感觉检索速度变慢，请检查 collection 索引状态。\\\n原则上，建议在**未索引 documents 数量达到10万条以上时**进行优化 — 但请务必根据您的具体业务场景灵活调整。","locale":"zh"},"3788":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"page","content":"Schema 演进","breadcrumbs":["Docs","产品","Zvec","使用指南","Collection"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","locale":"zh"},"3789":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"数据定义语言（DDL）","locale":"zh"},"3790":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"前置条件","locale":"zh"},"3791":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#column-ddl","content":"Column DDL","locale":"zh"},"3792":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"添加列","locale":"zh"},"3793":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"删除列","locale":"zh"},"3794":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#修改列","content":"修改列","locale":"zh"},"3795":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#查看当前-schema","content":"查看当前 Schema","locale":"zh"},"3796":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#index-ddl","content":"Index DDL","locale":"zh"},"3797":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#创建索引","content":"创建索引","locale":"zh"},"3798":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除索引","content":"删除索引","locale":"zh"},"3799":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"Zvec 支持**动态 Schema 演进**，允许你在 Collection 创建后修改其结构——无需停机、数据重新导入或重新索引。","locale":"zh"},"3800":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"支持的操作：","locale":"zh"},"3801":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **添加或删除标量字段**","locale":"zh"},"3802":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **重命名字段**或**更改数据类型**（需确保变更安全，如从 `INT32` 到 `INT64`）","locale":"zh"},"3803":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"✅ **创建或删除字段索引**","locale":"zh"},"3804":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","content":"❌  添加或删除向量字段（🔜 即将支持）","locale":"zh"},"3805":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"在 Zvec 中，Schema 变更通过\\*\\*数据定义语言（DDL）\\*\\*方法执行，分为两类：","locale":"zh"},"3806":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**Column DDL**：定义*你存储什么数据*。\n管理 Collection 的结构，包括添加、删除、重命名或修改字段。","locale":"zh"},"3807":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**Index DDL**：定义*你如何搜索数据*。\n控制字段上索引的创建和删除。","locale":"zh"},"3808":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"💡 **Zvec 索引规则**","locale":"zh"},"3809":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**每个向量字段都必须建索引**，使用合适的向量索引以支持相似度搜索。","locale":"zh"},"3810":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#数据定义语言ddl","content":"**标量字段索引是可选的**——但你应该为计划在过滤查询中使用的标量字段建立倒排索引（如 `WHERE category = 'music'`）。","locale":"zh"},"3811":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"本指南假设你已打开一个 Collection 并准备好了 `collection` 对象。","locale":"zh"},"3812":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#前置条件","content":"该示例 Collection 包含一个标量字段 `publish_year`。","locale":"zh"},"3813":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"使用 `add_column()` 向已有 Collection 添加新的标量字段：","locale":"zh"},"3814":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"`field_schema`：\n定义新字段的名称和数据类型。详见标量字段 Schema。","locale":"zh"},"3815":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"`expression`：\n为已有 Document 指定默认值。由于已有 Document 没有 `rating` 字段，Zvec 使用此 `expression` 填充缺失值——本例中将所有现有 Document 的 `rating` 设为 5。","locale":"zh"},"3816":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#添加列","content":"目前仅支持通过 `add_column()` 添加**数值型标量字段**。对 `string` 和 `boolean` 类型的支持即将推出。\n因此，`expression` 必须求值为数字——可以是单个数字字面量（如 `\"5\"`）或涉及已有数值字段的简单算术表达式（如 `\"publish_year + 1\"`）。","locale":"zh"},"3817":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"使用 `drop_column()` 永久删除标量字段：","locale":"zh"},"3818":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution#删除列","content":"此操作会**从 Collection 中每个 Document 删除该字段及其所有数据**。该操作**不可逆**。","locale":"zh"},"3819":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/collections/schema-evolution","tags"