ntent":"**训练样本数** — KMeans 训练采样的向量数量（`0` = 使用全部向量）","locale":"zh"},"4591":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引构建参数","content":"默认为 `0`。在超大数据集上设置较小的值（如 5,000,000）可加速训练并减少内存使用","locale":"zh"},"4592":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"参数","locale":"zh"},"4593":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"描述","locale":"zh"},"4594":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"调参指南","locale":"zh"},"4595":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"`ef`","locale":"zh"},"4596":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"**查询时候选池大小** — 查询时图遍历每步探索的候选邻居数","locale":"zh"},"4597":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/vector-index/hnsw-rabitq-index#索引查询参数","content":"• 更大的 `ef` →  ✨ 更高的 Recall  ⚠️ 更高的查询延迟","locale":"zh"},"4598":{"id":"/zh/docs/db/concepts/